This folder is intentionally empty.

The test target's sources are Tests/OpenFactorCoreTests, attached to it as a second
synchronised folder, so one suite runs both unsigned under swift test and inside the app
under xcodebuild test. See docs/PROJECT.md.

The folder itself still has to exist, because the project file references it and git does
not track empty directories. Deleting this file breaks a fresh clone. Tests that belong to
the app rather than the core would go here.
